  "content": "<h1><em><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bWMYAqyGe9g&amp;list=PLp0jZgheSlXv_vjilwnbrOtdbmgvz1VkC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/bWMYAqyGe9g?list=PLp0jZgheSlXv_vjilwnbrOtdbmgvz1VkC\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></a></em></h1>\n<h1>請注意！</h1>\n<p><em>下載前請務必閱讀以下內容並備份您的存檔！</em></p>\n<ul>\n<li>[僅限Fabric] 必須安裝<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Fabric API</strong></a>。請安裝對應Minecraft版本的最新版Fabric API。</li>\n<li>[僅限Fabric] <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmodmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Mod Menu</strong></a>為選裝項目，但可提供更便捷的模組設定方式。</li>\n<li>請<strong>檢查所有附加模組</strong>確保其相容最新版Minecraft Transit Railway！版本不符的附加模組將無法運作。</li>\n<li>歡迎在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mtrbbs.top%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MTRBBS</a>論壇提出問題、建議或錯誤回報！</li>\n<li>本模組<strong>不會</strong>為舊版Minecraft提供更新。原始碼已公開於GitHub，您可以自行修改。</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Minecraft Transit Railway 4.0.0</h2>\n<p><em>Minecraft Transit Railway</em>是一款<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraft.wiki%252fw%252fMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft模組</a>，讓您能建造包含自動化列車、船舶、纜車和飛機的交通系統！</p>\n<p>4.0.0版本為完全重寫版本。車輛運算代碼已與Minecraft主程式分離，大幅降低伺服器延遲。</p>\n\n<h2>4.0.0主要功能</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>自訂列車配置</li>\n<li>擬真轉向架與列車動態</li>\n<li>改良號誌系統</li>\n<li>橫向電梯</li>\n<li>從Nemo's Transit Expansion移植的OBJ功能</li>\n<li>車輛搖晃效果</li>\n<li>新版線路圖系統與OneBusAway整合</li>\n<li>客戶端FPS與伺服器TPS優化</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLp0jZgheSlXuQCXu9UynrKuBnq2Ef_TSI\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">觀看詳細功能展示</a></p>\n\n<h2>推薦附加模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-tube\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>倫敦地鐵附加模組</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjcm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Joban客戶端模組</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fstation-decoration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>車站裝飾</strong></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frussian-metro-addon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>俄羅斯地鐵附加模組</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>協助翻譯模組！</h2>\n<p>歡迎前往<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrwd.in%252fminecraft-transit-railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Transit Railway的Crowdin翻譯平台</a>！</p>\n<p>Crowdin是雲端翻譯協作平台。在您的協助下，我們能將模組翻譯成多國語言。您可免費註冊帳號開始翻譯。</p>\n\n<h2>有任何問題或建議？</h2>\n<p>歡迎聯繫我們。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.linkedin.com%252fin%252fjonathanho33\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/linked_in.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"mailto:jonho.minecraft@gmail.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/email.png\" alt=\"Email\"></a> &nbsp; <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/PVZ2nfUaTW\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/join-us-on-discord.png\" alt=\"加入Discord社群\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/minecraft_transit_railway\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jonafanho/Minecraft-Transit-Railway/master/images/footer/become-a-patron-on-patreon.png\" alt=\"成為Patreon贊助者\"></a> <img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/49fd23a75fd384b28d486c1471a72b7d4677c821.jpeg\" alt=\"圖片1\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d2718\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e2f99c38fc8db3ae5fd89f534aae45129cf6987b.jpeg\" alt=\"圖片2\"></a></p>",
